title: SPYarn
---
Hello!
This is a script testing the use of Sprites at the current moment. Does that make sense?
-> Yeah!
    I love the Enthusiasm
-> Duh...
    Fair enough, it's a test Scene after all...
<<instance_sprite 1 0 0>>
This is the sprite of the Mentor. 
Is it there? 
-> Yep
    Good it works. 
-> Nope
    Uh Oh
Ok, let's change sprites now, just press space to cycle through the sprite list. 
<<change_sprite 1 1>>
Happy
<<change_sprite 1 2>>
Sad
<<change_sprite 1 3>>
Angry
<<change_sprite 1 4>>
Shocked
<<change_sprite 1 5>>
Scared
<<change_sprite 1 6>>
Shy
<<change_sprite 1 0>>
Neutral 

Let's try moving the sprite and stuff. 
<<move_sprite 1 7 0 10>>

Now that the sprites have cycled manually, let's deleting the sprite. 
<<destroy_sprite 1>>

Is it destroyed? 
-> Yes
    sweet
-> No 
    shoot

Ok that's it for now. 
===
